{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32400","headline":"送襄州李中丞赴从事 · 温庭筠","name":"送襄州李中丞赴从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉庭文采有相如，天子通宵爱子虚。\n把钓看棊高兴尽，焚香起草宦情疎。\n楚山重叠当归路，溪月分明到直庐。\n江雨潇潇帆一片，此行谁道爲鲈鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32400.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32400","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}